Here's the distribution for uncrowned prayer timeouts:

  0.2%: under 70
  0.6%: between  44 and 88
  2.3%: between  58 and 117
  9.4%: between  87 and 175
 37.5%: between  175 and 350
 37.5%: between  350 and 700
  9.4%: between  700 and 1400
  2.3%: between 1050 and 2100
  0.6%: between 1400 and 2800
  0.2%: over 1750 

So close to 90% of the time the timeout is below 700. So 700 is 
probabilistically a good target. If you wait until 1400 then you're safe
97% of the time.

